    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359650/extras/6bef7685e325e65bd33685e1627b6136.poster.avif?t=1617647378\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359650/extras/6bef7685e325e65bd33685e1627b6136.webm?t=1617647378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359650/extras/6bef7685e325e65bd33685e1627b6136.mp4?t=1617647378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>The Last of Waifus</strong> is a third-person shooter game in post-apocalyptic theme. You are playing as the last Waifu clearing out the fallen city from Infected whose only target is you.<br><br>Enjoy the thrill - endlessly, if you dare.. Do not expect it to ever get better, though.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> third-person shooter <br></li><li> dynamic action gameplay<br></li><li> post-apocalyptic world</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add the game to your Wishlist and be the first one in line!</h2>",
